{"4134310":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Saraab: Beyond The Veil","steam_appid":4134310,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5397600],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/610f6c3f2d7eec462d1419fb1ccdd077.poster.avif?t=1793724437\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/610f6c3f2d7eec462d1419fb1ccdd077.webm?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/610f6c3f2d7eec462d1419fb1ccdd077.mp4?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face your demons. Embrace your rebirth. Shape destiny itself.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Story:<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her younger brother Adam vanishes, Elham &quot;Elly&quot; is pulled into a nightmare she never chose. She discovers that his disappearance is tied to a destiny she can no longer ignore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by a mysterious being and haunted by the shadow that follows her, Elham must awaken a dormant light within herself. She is forced to face the wounds she has spent a lifetime avoiding. Every encounter, whether with dark entities or pieces of her own psyche, brings her closer to the truth about Adam and about who she really is.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Saraab<\/i> is an atmospheric, narrative‑driven psychological horror visual novel about self‑worth, sorrow, and the quiet terror of being seen. Your choices shape Elham’s path. Will she succumb to the darkness, or embrace the light?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/d446ea9667bdf497ca2756dd236899ba.poster.avif?t=1793724437\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/d446ea9667bdf497ca2756dd236899ba.webm?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/d446ea9667bdf497ca2756dd236899ba.mp4?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand‑drawn anime‑style visuals and a haunting, emotional soundtrack.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow‑burn story that explores trauma, resilience, and the duality of the human heart.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > toward awakening.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Elham’s consciousness, confronting the past to reclaim her future.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make meaningful choices leading to multiple endings, new powers, and different demons to face inspired by Arabian folklore.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dyslexia‑friendly Atkinson Hyperlegible font for a more accessible reading experience.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo is available in 8 languages: (English, Spanish (Latin American), Spanish (Spain),  Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese (Brazil), Korean and Arabic.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/9f1c7b5a5d91a5ed4f10e1b1dfee43c4.poster.avif?t=1793724437\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/9f1c7b5a5d91a5ed4f10e1b1dfee43c4.webm?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/9f1c7b5a5d91a5ed4f10e1b1dfee43c4.mp4?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/610f6c3f2d7eec462d1419fb1ccdd077.poster.avif?t=1793724437\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/610f6c3f2d7eec462d1419fb1ccdd077.webm?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/610f6c3f2d7eec462d1419fb1ccdd077.mp4?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face your demons. Embrace your rebirth. Shape destiny itself.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Story:<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her younger brother Adam vanishes, Elham &quot;Elly&quot; is pulled into a nightmare she never chose. She discovers that his disappearance is tied to a destiny she can no longer ignore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by a mysterious being and haunted by the shadow that follows her, Elham must awaken a dormant light within herself. She is forced to face the wounds she has spent a lifetime avoiding. Every encounter, whether with dark entities or pieces of her own psyche, brings her closer to the truth about Adam and about who she really is.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Saraab<\/i> is an atmospheric, narrative‑driven psychological horror visual novel about self‑worth, sorrow, and the quiet terror of being seen. Your choices shape Elham’s path. Will she succumb to the darkness, or embrace the light?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/d446ea9667bdf497ca2756dd236899ba.poster.avif?t=1793724437\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/d446ea9667bdf497ca2756dd236899ba.webm?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/d446ea9667bdf497ca2756dd236899ba.mp4?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:<\/u><\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand‑drawn anime‑style visuals and a haunting, emotional soundtrack.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow‑burn story that explores trauma, resilience, and the duality of the human heart.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > toward awakening.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Elham’s consciousness, confronting the past to reclaim her future.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make meaningful choices leading to multiple endings, new powers, and different demons to face inspired by Arabian folklore.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dyslexia‑friendly Atkinson Hyperlegible font for a more accessible reading experience.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo is available in 8 languages: (English, Spanish (Latin American), Spanish (Spain),  Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese (Brazil), Korean and Arabic.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/9f1c7b5a5d91a5ed4f10e1b1dfee43c4.poster.avif?t=1793724437\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/9f1c7b5a5d91a5ed4f10e1b1dfee43c4.webm?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/extras\/9f1c7b5a5d91a5ed4f10e1b1dfee43c4.mp4?t=1793724437\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A psychological horror visual novel about healing, where saving your brother means facing your own demons. Elham’s search pulls her through visions and entities rooted in Arabian folklore, and family secrets that should have stayed buried.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/91e90f7ef5ff1ee41f932edd8bcf5648e0f2fd79\/header.jpg?t=1793724437","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4134310\/e2fe85d797068290ca104834acf75dade49b4c6f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793724437","capsule_ima